      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         CHURCH LANE                                              (south-east side) 5/316                                        Nos. (18) & 20, Apple-by-                                              Millbank GV                                           II House, formerly 3 cottages, C17 altered, timber framed with brick infilling, thatched roof with half-hipped gable 2 brick chimneys; 1 storey and attic, one eyebrow window under thatch to LH, gable end on RH has 3-light leaded casement to each floor. LH recessed wing has door to RH, 3-light casement to LH. RCHM I p.317. MON.26. Listing NGR: SP8587610596"
